{"id": "EUVD-2026-102505", "enisaUuid": "b6149d09-f4c0-39b3-be01-5760f81ee22d", "description": "cool-admin-midway through 8.0.0 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability that allows non-superadmin admins to read, modify, or delete other admins' roles by supplying arbitrary role ids. Attackers holding ordinary sys:role permissions can call /admin/sys/role/info, update, or delete with another admin's role id to rewrite menu and department grants, changing other users' effective access.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T21:43:49", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T16:32:15", "baseScore": 7.0, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:H/UI:N/VC:L/VI:H/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/cool-admin-midway-base-crud-role-ownership-idor", "https://github.com/cool-team-official/cool-admin-midway/blob/e545ef6f3b0c08581e34bd3207ca57d851ccc3ae/src/modules/base/controller/admin/sys/role.ts#L11-L36", "https://github.com/cool-team-official/cool-admin-midway/blob/e545ef6f3b0c08581e34bd3207ca57d851ccc3ae/src/modules/base/service/sys/role.ts#L54-L118", "https://github.com/cool-team-official/cool-admin-midway", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/cool-admin-midway-through-8.0.0-missing-authorization-via-system-role-endpoints"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111365", "GHSA-654q-53gj-v4xg"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.26, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "5dc75129-efa0-36cf-8b6f-ecc90f2e87d2", "product": {"name": "cool-admin-midway", "vendor": {"name": "cool-team-official"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22648.0.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "5761ea4f-98ef-3389-b5a5-8a8cf4578a57", "vendor": {"name": "cool-team-official"}}], "isExploited": false}